    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><strong>Elusive Verge</strong> is an exhilarating blend of open-world exploration and strategic warfare set in the boundless expanse of space. As a resourceful commander, your mission is to navigate the dangers of the cosmos, reclaim moons captured by a rogue A.I., and secure the future of your faction. With a rich narrative, dynamic environments, and deep strategic gameplay, <strong>Elusive Verge</strong> offers an immersive space odyssey unlike any other.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/dc5d3d27f2c99efc0854d0bc81a4157b.poster.avif?t=1711400779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/dc5d3d27f2c99efc0854d0bc81a4157b.webm?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/dc5d3d27f2c99efc0854d0bc81a4157b.mp4?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Open-World Exploration</h2>Travel through a vast, procedurally generated universe filled with celestial wonders, hidden artifacts, and untold dangers. Each journey promises new discoveries and challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/922f59ccfd47f3323891cf6f8b1bfbec.poster.avif?t=1711400779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/922f59ccfd47f3323891cf6f8b1bfbec.webm?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/922f59ccfd47f3323891cf6f8b1bfbec.mp4?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Base Building</h2>Construct and expand orbital bases around moons. Develop your infrastructure, manage resources, and defend against hostile threats to ensure the survival of your command centers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/ae9487a8ecebf46d58bdabada1e15a87.poster.avif?t=1711400779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/ae9487a8ecebf46d58bdabada1e15a87.webm?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/ae9487a8ecebf46d58bdabada1e15a87.mp4?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tactical Space Combat</h2>Engage in thrilling real-time battles against the rogue A.I. forces. Customize your fleet, leverage the environment, and employ advanced technologies to emerge victorious.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/709f076b0dc090258e5c1c4d32fe987e.poster.avif?t=1711400779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/709f076b0dc090258e5c1c4d32fe987e.webm?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/709f076b0dc090258e5c1c4d32fe987e.mp4?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resource Management and Colonization</h2>Harvest resources from asteroids and moons to fuel your expansion. Colonize hostile territories, turning them into bastions of your civilization's resilience and ingenuity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Technology Research</h2>Unlock and upgrade a vast array of technologies. From devastating weapons to critical life-support systems, your ability to adapt and innovate will be the key to your success.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><strong>Elusive Verge</strong> is an exhilarating blend of open-world exploration and strategic warfare set in the boundless expanse of space. As a resourceful commander, your mission is to navigate the dangers of the cosmos, reclaim moons captured by a rogue A.I., and secure the future of your faction. With a rich narrative, dynamic environments, and deep strategic gameplay, <strong>Elusive Verge</strong> offers an immersive space odyssey unlike any other.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/dc5d3d27f2c99efc0854d0bc81a4157b.poster.avif?t=1711400779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/dc5d3d27f2c99efc0854d0bc81a4157b.webm?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/dc5d3d27f2c99efc0854d0bc81a4157b.mp4?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Open-World Exploration</h2>Travel through a vast, procedurally generated universe filled with celestial wonders, hidden artifacts, and untold dangers. Each journey promises new discoveries and challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/922f59ccfd47f3323891cf6f8b1bfbec.poster.avif?t=1711400779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/922f59ccfd47f3323891cf6f8b1bfbec.webm?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/922f59ccfd47f3323891cf6f8b1bfbec.mp4?t=1711400779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Base Building</h2>Construct and expa